{"id":"6f3411be790eb1c9","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-untyped-nonconservative.md","title":"PA 加 COMP 是无类型而算术保守的反例","display":"thm-untyped-nonconservative — PA 加 COMP 是无类型而算术保守的反例","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-untyped-nonconservative","aliases":["91-thm-untyped-nonconservative"],"display":"thm-untyped-nonconservative — PA 加 COMP 是无类型而算术保守的反例","depends_on":["[[91-df-untyped-truth]]","[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","[[91-df-coded-syntax]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-untyped-nonconservative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-untyped-nonconservative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-untyped-nonconservative — PA 加 COMP 是无类型而算术保守的反例"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"52e708105e8ce779\" href=\"?note=52e708105e8ce779\" title=\"91-df-untyped-truth\">91-df-untyped-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_T=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(D_T=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_0=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(D_0=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 在扩展语言中只保留算术归纳。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{COMP}\\coloneqq\\forall a(D_T(a)\\to(T(a)\\lor T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))))\">\\(\\mathrm{COMP}\\coloneqq\\forall a(D_T(a)\\to(T(a)\\lor T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{COMP}\\})\">\\(U=\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{COMP}\\})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TypeFreeTh}\">\\(\\operatorname{TypeFreeTh}\\)</span> 取原书 Definition 10.1；PA 一致。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConservTh}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConservTh}\\)</span> 为共同算术语言保守性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}untyped\\text{-}nonconservative}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{TypeFreeTh}(U)\\quad\\land\\quad\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(U,\\mathrm{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}untyped\\text{-}nonconservative}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{TypeFreeTh}(U)\\quad\\land\\quad\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(U,\\mathrm{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保守性有有效证明变换：把每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(t)\">\\(T(t)\\)</span> 统一替换成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=0\">\\(0=0\\)</span>，COMP 变成 PA 可证句，算术公理和结论保持原样，因此任何算术 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 证明化成 PA 证明。\n取一个含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的标准句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>。COMP 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\sigma\\urcorner})\\lor T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\sigma\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\sigma\\urcorner})\\lor T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\sigma\\urcorner})\\)</span>，且两个代码均非基础句，由此证明存在含真理的真句。它反驳第一有类型分支（否则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 矛盾），并以算术公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\ne x\">\\(x\\ne x\\)</span> 反驳第二分支，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 无类型。\n旧文以 UTB 作无类型反例，不符合原书判据。UTB 本身仍保守，但原书把它分类为有类型。原书还证明只留算术归纳的 FS<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\upharpoonright\">\\(\\upharpoonright\\)</span> 保守，提供更丰富的无类型例子。</p>\n<p>来源：第 10 章的 Definition 10.1 及其讨论，印刷页 128–130，PDF 页 139–141；\n§14.2 末，印刷页 171，PDF 页 182；保守性替换证明为直接推导。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-untyped-truth","status":"resolved","id":"52e708105e8ce779","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-untyped-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D_T=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"D_0=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{COMP}\\coloneqq\\forall a(D_T(a)\\to(T(a)\\lor T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))))","display":false},{"tex":"U=\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{COMP}\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TypeFreeTh}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConservTh}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}untyped\\text{-}nonconservative}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{TypeFreeTh}(U)\\quad\\land\\quad\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(U,\\mathrm{PA}).","display":true},{"tex":"T(t)","display":false},{"tex":"0=0","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\sigma\\urcorner})\\lor T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\sigma\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"x\\ne x","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\upharpoonright","display":false}],"bytes":2026,"backlinks":[{"id":"52e708105e8ce779","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书“type-free”指第二项，不等同于第一项。TB、UTB、CT 的语言也能形成自应用真理原子，却被原书判为有类型，因为它们不规定含真理句的外延。\n无类型理论可以通过编码量化的组合子句、规则或其他受控公理限制含 $T$ 句的真理行为；这不授权全语言透明双条件。原书 PA+COMP 是无类型但保守的例子，见 [[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative]]。"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-160","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-161","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.m